<title>UK: SOCCER-LAUDRUP NAMED SCOTTISH PLAYER OF THE YEAR.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LAUDRUP NAMED SCOTTISH PLAYER OF THE YEAR.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark international Brian Laudrup has been named Scottish player of the year for the second time.</p>
<p>The Rangers striker collected the accolade from the Scottish Football Writers' Association. He won it first in 1995.</p>
<p>Laudrup has been a key figure this season as Rangers won a ninth successive premier division title.</p>
